## 1. Executive Summary

NextGen Interactive Media, Inc. is positioned to launch its latest interactive gaming project, *Realm of Legends*, in Q4 2024. This report outlines our development, publishing, and monetization strategies. Leveraging our partnerships with industry leaders such as Epic Games and Unity Technologies, we aim to provide a cutting-edge gaming experience across multiple platforms including PC, PlayStation 5, and Xbox Series X. Our monetization strategy will include in-game purchases, a subscription model, and ad revenues, with a projected revenue target of $15 million in the first year post-launch.

---

## 2. Introduction

NextGen Interactive Media, located in San Francisco, California, specializes in the development of immersive video games. With a team of over 150 dedicated professionals, our mission is to push the boundaries of interactive entertainment. The rise of mobile gaming and the growing popularity of virtual reality (VR) platforms have opened new avenues for our business. This report provides a comprehensive overview of our strategies to ensure the successful development and launch of *Realm of Legends*.

