## 3. Development Strategy

### 3.1 Project Overview

*Realm of Legends* is an MMORPG that combines elements of fantasy with innovative gameplay mechanics. The project is spearheaded by lead designer Alex Chen, with a development timeline spanning from January 2023 to October 2024. The game will feature rich storytelling, dynamic environments, and a robust character customization system.

### 3.2 Development Process

The development process follows the Agile methodology, allowing for iterative testing and feedback. Key milestones include:

- **Pre-Production (January 2023 - June 2023)**: Concept art and initial prototypes were created. The project team, led by Alex Chen and technical lead Maria Gomez, established the core game mechanics and narrative.
  
- **Production (July 2023 - June 2024)**: The full development team, which includes 60 software engineers and 30 artists, will work on coding, asset creation, and level design. The integration of AI-driven NPCs is a significant focus, with support from our AI specialist, Dr. James Liu.

- **Testing (July 2024 - September 2024)**: A closed beta will commence in July 2024, involving 10,000 players recruited through our partnership with Twitch and Discord. Feedback will inform final adjustments before the public launch.

### 3.3 Technology Stack

The game will utilize the Unreal Engine 5, provided by Epic Games, for its advanced graphics capabilities. The backend will be supported by Amazon Web Services (AWS) for scalable cloud infrastructure, ensuring reliable performance during peak user engagement. Our development team will also integrate PlayFab for player management and analytics.

